    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46353" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζύ̆γ-ωμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bolt, bar</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				7.16.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>cross-rod</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Apollod.
				<u>Poliorc.</u>
				177.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζυγόν</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				111.1
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.29
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>arcus zygomaticus</i>, which connects the cranial with the
			facial bones, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				2.437
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				746
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.85
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζυγοειδής</span>.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζυγόν</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Alm.</u>
				7.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b>
			<i>canal-lock,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PFlor.
				273.20
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>.</div>
